Upstream
--------
MBC-2.0 is built on the MBC 1.0 protocol core from the MinecraftBotClient project:
    https://github.com/creaddinscart/MinecraftBotClient
The connection/protocol layer (src/network/connection_manager.py), the version
checker, the logger, the i18n dictionary, the settings manager and the console UI
originate from that upstream project (CREADDINSCART STUDIO) and retain their attribution.

Code reuse (CREADDINSCART STUDIO condition 4)
---------------------------------------------
- src/features/bot_swarm.py — extends the upstream multi-bot swarm; the worker/auth
  logic is from CREADDINSCART STUDIO (MinecraftBotClient).
- src/client/minecraft_bot_client.py — client loop and command handling derive from the
  upstream project; the collaborative swarm console (run_swarm + .collab) is new in 2.0.
- src/features/operator_hub.py and src/ui/collab_client.py — new in MBC-2.0, published
  by CREADDINSCART STUDIO and the joint authors.

